+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/DevilTower.txt#974 (npctalk)
- "Morocc Lord Knight: Really.. the Assassin guild who I thought was on a mission to balance power in the world."
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/DevilTower.txt#975 (npctalk)
- "Morocc Lord Knight: Resurrecting the demon would bring balance! Even the mightiest become slaves to a god.."
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/DevilTower.txt#976 (npctalk)
- "Morocc Lord Knight: The gods have their own plans. Do you know what the gods plan for you or I?"
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/DevilTower.txt#977 (npctalk)
- "Morocc Lord Knight: They want this world to only be in their image. Where do we fit into that?!"
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/DevilTower.txt#978 (npctalk)
- "Loki: Shut up!"
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/DevilTower.txt#979 (npctalk)
